  "bodyHash": "d6c403ec8a160394",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>Fadeless</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">这是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-fade\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Fade</a> 针对 1.20 及更高版本的分支版本。<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你是否厌倦了进入 Minecraft 时漫长的过渡动画？Fadeless 是一款客户端模组，可移除 Minecraft 中的所有淡出动画。这包括从 Mojang 启动画面到主菜单的淡出，以及重新加载纹理后的淡出效果。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>与原版相比有哪些更新？</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;支持 1.20 及更高版本。<br></span></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;支持 Forge 和 NeoForge！</span></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;移除更多淡出动画！</span></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;提供配置文件，允许你自定义开关淡出效果。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h1><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DerpDerpling/Fadeless/refs/heads/1.21/assets/fadeless_comparison.webp\" alt=\"Fadeless 对比动图\" width=\"800\" height=\"269\"></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:36px\">本模组是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-fade\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Fade</a> 的分支版本。原作者已 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fDerpDerpling%252fi.derpy.xyz%252fmain%252fimg%252fproof.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">授权我</a> 重新上传/维护此项目。所有荣誉归于 <a href=\"https://github.com/UltimateBoomer\" rel=\"nofollow\">UltimateBoomer。</a></span></h6>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
